          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\" />\\n  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Reach out to {{BUSINESS_NAME}} for integrative, whole-person care. Ask about new-patient intensives, tailored plans, and educational resources.\\\"/>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg1:#FFFDF8;\\n      --bg2:#F3FFF8;\\n      --accent:#7C5CF6;\\n      --muted:#6B7280;\\n      --card:#FFFFFF;\\n      --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.65);\\n      --shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(17,24,39,0.08);\\n      --radius:14px;\\n      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial;\\n    }\\n\\n    /* Page background: blended gradient + inline SVG pattern for visual richness */\\n    html,body{height:100%;}\\n    body{\\n      margin:0;\\n      min-height:100%;\\n      background: radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 10% 20%, rgba(124,92,246,0.06), transparent 10%), radial-gradient(900px 500px at 90% 80%, rgba(124,92,246,0.04), transparent 12%), linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg1),var(--bg2));\\n      color:#0f172a;\\n      -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased; -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;\\n      padding:48px 24px;\\n      box-sizing:border-box;\\n      background-image:\\n        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.6), rgba(255,255,255,0.4)),\\n        url('data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"800\\\" height=\\\"800\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 800 800\\\"><defs><linearGradient id=\\\"g\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop stop-color=\\\"%237C5CF6\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.08\\\" offset=\\\"0\\\"/><stop stop-color=\\\"%23007A6E\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.06\\\" offset=\\\"1\\\"/></linearGradient></defs><g fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"rgba(124,92,246,0.07)\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1\\\"><path d=\\\"M0 160c80-40 160-40 240 0s160 40 240 0 160-40 240 0v640H0z\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"120\\\" cy=\\\"120\\\" r=\\\"18\\\" fill=\\\"%237C5CF6\\\" fill-opacity=\\\"0.06\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"680\\\" cy=\\\"240\\\" r=\\\"36\\\" fill=\\\"%23007A6E\\\" fill-opacity=\\\"0.04\\\"/></g></svg>');\\n      background-repeat:repeat;\\n      background-attachment:fixed;\\n    }\\n\\n    .container{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px;}\\n\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}\\n    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#00A896);box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(124,92,246,0.14);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700}\\n    nav{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}\\n    nav a{color:rgba(15,23,42,0.75);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:600}\\n    nav a[href$=\\\"contact.html\\\"]{background:rgba(124,92,246,0.08);color:var(--accent)}\\n\\n    main{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px}\\n\\n    /* Hero */\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px;padding:26px;border-radius:var(--radius);background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.82), rgba(255,255,255,0.6));box-shadow:var(--shadow);backdrop-filter: blur(6px)}\\n    .kicker{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.09em}\\n    h1{margin:0;font-size:28px;line-height:1.08}\\n    p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted);max-width:62ch}\\n\\n    .grid-2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 380px;gap:20px}\\n\\n    /* Card */\\n    .card{background:var(--card);border-radius:12px;padding:18px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}\\n    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n\\n    /* Contact form */\\n    form{display:grid;gap:12px}\\n    input[type=text], input[type=email], textarea, select{width:100%;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.06);font-size:15px}\\n    textarea{min-height:110px;resize:vertical}\\n    .row{display:flex;gap:12px}\\n    .row > *{flex:1}\\n    .cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#00A896);color:white;font-weight:700;border:none;cursor:pointer}\\n\\n    /* Social proof */\\n    .reviews{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\\n    .review{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(124,92,246,0.04),rgba(0,122,110,0.02));padding:12px;border-radius:10px}\\n    .stars{color:#F59E0B;font-weight:700}\\n\\n    /* Benefits */\\n    .benefits{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px}\\n    .benefit{padding:14px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.9),rgba(255,255,255,0.7));border:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.04)}\\n\\n    /* Process */\\n    .steps{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\\n    .step{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}\\n    .step .num{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FFF,rgba(124,92,246,0.08));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:800;color:var(--accent)}\\n\\n    /* FAQ */\\n    .faq{display:grid;gap:12px}\\n    details{background:var(--card);padding:12px;border-radius:10px}\\n\\n    /* Lead magnet */\\n    .leadmag{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(124,92,246,0.06),rgba(0,122,110,0.03));border:1px solid rgba(124,92,246,0.06)}\\n    .leadmag .title{font-weight:800}\\n\\n    footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;background:transparent;color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    @media (max-width:880px){\\n      .grid-2{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n      .benefits{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"logo\\\">HM</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav aria-label=\\\"Primary\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Care & Services</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"conditions.html\\\">Common Concerns</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">Our Way</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Investment</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">Meet</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Schedule</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Reach Out</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <main>\\n      <!-- Hero: a warm, clear invitation to connect -->\\n      <section class=\\\"hero card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"contact-hero\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <div class=\\\"kicker\\\">Reach out</div>\\n          <h1 id=\\\"contact-hero\\\">Unhurried, whole-person care starts with a conversation</h1>\\n          <p class=\\\"lead\\\">Whether youâ€™re exploring an intensive new-patient consultation or want to ask about lab options and ongoing support, {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}, and the team are here to listen. We emphasize education, root-focused planning, and collaborative choices â€” not promises of cures.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:8px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Office</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-left:auto\\\">Call us: <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none;font-weight:700\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"grid-2\\\">\\n        <!-- Left column: contact form + social proof -->\\n        <div>\\n          <section class=\\\"card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"contact-form-title\\\">\\n            <h2 id=\\\"contact-form-title\\\">Send a note or request a call</h2>\\n            <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Use this form for appointment requests, referral questions, or to ask about our intensive onboarding option. We typically reply within 48 hours on business days.</p>\\n\\n            <form action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" onsubmit=\\\"document.getElementById('submitBtn').disabled=true;\\\">\\n              <label class=\\\"muted\\\">Full name</label>\\n              <input type=\\\"text\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your name\\\" required />\\n\\n              <div class=\\\"row\\\">\\n                <div>\\n                  <label class=\\\"muted\\\">Phone</label>\\n                  <input type=\\\"text\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" placeholder=\\\"{{PHONE}}\\\" />\\n                </div>\\n                <div>\\n                  <label class=\\\"muted\\\">Email</label>\\n                  <input type=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"{{EMAIL}}\\\" required />\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <label class=\\\"muted\\\">Reason for reaching out</label>\\n              <select name=\\\"reason\\\">\\n                <option>New patient: intensive evaluation</option>\\n                <option>Follow-up / existing patient</option>\\n                <option>Request labs or records</option>\\n                <option>General question</option>\\n              </select>\\n\\n              <label class=\\\"muted\\\">Tell us briefly about your main concern</label>\\n              <textarea name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"What are you hoping to address? Any recent tests, meds, or questions?\\\" required></textarea>\\n\\n              <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-top:6px;\\\">\\n                <button id=\\\"submitBtn\\\" class=\\\"cta\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>\\n                <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Or call us: <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:700\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <p class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"font-size:13px;margin-top:10px\\\">By contacting us you consent to receive communication from {{BUSINESS_NAME}}. Medical advice is provided during appointments; messages are for scheduling and triage. We do not offer guaranteed cures, and information shared is educational.</p>\\n            </form>\\n          </section>\\n\\n          <section class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\">\\n            <h3>What patients say</h3>\\n            <div class=\\\"reviews\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"review\\\">\\n                <div class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★★</div>\\n                <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">A thoughtful reset</div>\\n                <div class=\\\"muted\\\">\\\"I felt listened to for the first time in years. The intake was thorough and the plan was practical.\\\" — A client in {{CITY}}</div>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <div class=\\\"review\\\">\\n                <div class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★★</div>\\n                <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Education + results</div>\\n                <div class=\\\"muted\\\">\\\"Clear education about labs and lifestyle helped me regain energy without unrealistic promises.\\\" — Another client</div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </section>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- Right column: Practical info, benefits, process -->\\n        <aside>\\n          <section class=\\\"card\\\">\\n            <h3>Quick details</h3>\\n            <p class=\\\"muted\\\"><strong>Practitioner:</strong> {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}</p>\\n            <p class=\\\"muted\\\"><strong>Email:</strong> <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>\\n            <p class=\\\"muted\\\"><strong>Appointments:</strong> In-person and telehealth options available.</p>\\n            <p class=\\\"muted\\\"><strong>New-patient intensive:</strong> Designed for deeper assessment, extended visit time, and focused education.</p>\\n          </section>\\n\\n          <section class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n            <h3>Why people reach us</h3>\\n            <div class=\\\"benefits\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"benefit\\\"><strong>Holistic assessment</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">Lifestyle, labs, environment, and stress all considered.</div></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"benefit\\\"><strong>Personalized plans</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">Small, evidence-informed steps that fit your life.</div></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"benefit\\\"><strong>Educational focus</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">We explain reasoning, so you can make informed choices.</div></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"benefit\\\"><strong>Optional labs</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">We discuss what testing may add and what it doesn't promise.</div></div>\\n            </div>\\n          </section>\\n\\n          <section class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n            <h3>Our intake & planning process</h3>\\n            <div class=\\\"steps\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"step\\\"><div class=\\\"num\\\">1</div><div><strong>Intake conversation</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">Deep history + priorities so we hear your whole story.</div></div></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"step\\\"><div class=\\\"num\\\">2</div><div><strong>Tailored plan</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">Lifestyle, supportive therapies, and optional testing are suggested as appropriate.</div></div></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"step\\\"><div class=\\\"num\\\">3</div><div><strong>Follow-ups</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">Shorter visits for refinement; education and monitoring continue.</div></div></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"step\\\"><div class=\\\"num\\\">Lab</div><div><strong>Optional testing</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">Labs used as tools — helpful for clarity but not always necessary.</div></div></div>\\n            </div>\\n          </section>\\n        </aside>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <!-- FAQ: focused on contact & process -->\\n      <section class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">\\n        <h3>Questions we often get</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"faq\\\">\\n          <details>\\n            <summary style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">How do I book a new-patient intensive?</summary>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Choose \\\"New patient: intensive evaluation\\\" in the form or call us. Intensives are longer appointments for a comprehensive assessment and collaborative planning.</div>\\n          </details>\\n\\n          <details>\\n            <summary style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Do you accept insurance?</summary>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">We provide invoices and superbills that you may submit to your insurer. Coverage varies; contact your carrier to confirm. We also offer self-pay options.</div>\\n          </details>\\n\\n          <details>\\n            <summary style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Is remote care available?</summary>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Yes. Many follow-ups and educational sessions are available by telehealth. Some in-person visits may be recommended depending on testing or physical exam needs.</div>\\n          </details>\\n\\n          <details>\\n            <summary style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Will you promise a cure?</summary>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">We prioritize honesty: we cannot guarantee cures. Our aim is to educate, address root contributors, and co-create realistic plans tailored to you.</div>\\n          </details>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <!-- Lead magnet: downloadable guide -->\\n      <section class=\\\"leadmag card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"leadmag\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <div id=\\\"leadmag\\\" class=\\\"title\\\">Free guide: 5 Steps to Restore Balance</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">A short ebook that introduces practical habits and questions to bring to your first visit.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center\\\">\\n          <form action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" style=\\\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center\\\">\\n            <input type=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"lead_email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your email\\\" required style=\\\"padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.06)\\\" />\\n            <button class=\\\"cta\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Get the guide</button>\\n          </form>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <!-- Call to action footer -->\\n      <section style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\" class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">Ready to start?</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Book an intensive visit or send us a message. Weâ€™ll help you choose the right next step.</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:8px\\\">\\n            <a href=\\\"book.html\\\" class=\\\"cta\\\" style=\\\"background:linear-gradient(90deg,#00A896,var(--accent));\\\">Book a visit</a>\\n            <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" class=\\\"cta\\\" style=\\\"background:linear-gradient(90deg,#F59E0B,var(--accent));\\\">Email us</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div class=\\\"muted\\\">© <span id=\\\"year\\\">2026</span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Integrative, educational care</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Questions? <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> · <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <script>\\n    // small script to keep year current\\n    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();\\n  </script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"Chunk: holistic_medicine-2026-02-16T20-14-55-094Z-017 (layoutFamily: aura_editorial)\\n\\nFiles included in this bundle (chunk 4):\\n- contact.html  — Contact & outreach page with full section pack (hero, social_proof, benefits, process, faq, lead_magnet, cta).\\n\\nNotes and conventions:\\n- Placeholders left for templating: {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}, {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}.\\n- Visuals: background uses CSS gradients and an embedded SVG pattern (data URI). No external images, fonts, or CDNs are referenced.\\n- Tone/voice: playful_premium with clear educational framing; avoids promises or guaranteed cures per content rules.\\n- Contact form submits to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}. Secondary actions include mailto: and tel: links.\\n\\nAccessibility & responsive notes:\\n- Uses semantic elements (header, main, footer, section, details) and accessible labels for form controls.\\n- Layout is responsive: two-column grid collapses on narrow screens.\\n\\nHolistic medicine rules observed:\\n- No guaranteed cures; language emphasizes education, whole-person assessment, and collaborative planning.\\n- The contact page includes clear wording on new-patient intensives and optional labs; other site pages should contain condition-specific content with disclaimers per project rules.\\n\\nDevelopment:\\n- This chunk intentionally does not create external assets (SVG file at assets/img/pattern.svg) due to chunk constraints; the page embeds its own SVG pattern inline for visual richness. If a shared pattern file is provided by another chunk, pages may be adjusted to reference it.\\n\\nIf you need a variant with the external assets/img/pattern.svg file created here, request the next chunk to include assets.\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
